NAME
    gcloud workload-identity service-agents - manage Service Agents for
        Workload Identity

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud workload-identity service-agents COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Service Agents for Workload Identity.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     generate
        Generate service agents for a service producer.

NOTES
    These variants are also available:

        $ gcloud alpha workload-identity service-agents

        $ gcloud beta workload-identity service-agents

